5,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We need a system that is fair and sustainable. I'll look into last year's tax, insurance and parking papers and the spell of checking each other's figures.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree. To avoid future friction, I'll check what two other car-sharing households said and the spell of checking each other's figures.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I'm more concerned with the daily reality. I'll investigate the state of the car at handover and trips that repeat weekly.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Logic dictates we start with the numbers. I'll check last year's fuel receipts and hours of use recorded in the diary.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just want to know about the effort involved. I'll look at the month's trial of recording every run and weeks of heavy use over the year.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, it's interesting we both chose the figures check. Let's see what that reveals about our dynamics.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. It's often the ""correction"" phase that causes the most tension in these arrangements.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, the hours of use are fine, but they don't tell us if the car was actually available when needed.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"True, but without a baseline of who is actually driving, any ""fair"" payment plan is just a guess.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I hope we can find a way that doesn't require so much... talking and planning every night.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
