30,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The fixed costs are over 280,000 yen. Also, it seems checking figures created a lot of resentment and apologies.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Other households say the ""asking for favors"" part is what sours things. And yes, the figure-checking was a disaster for us.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"It's a mess. The car is often returned with the fuel light on and rubbish inside, and weekly trips keep collapsing.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The fuel spending is completely lopsided; two people paid for most of it. Also, weekends are used three times more than Tuesdays.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Recording every run took an hour a week. And those heavy-use weeks cost us entire evenings of coordination.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, if the fuel is that lopsided, a simple even split of costs is definitely not fair.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Daisuke, it sounds like the administrative burden is just as taxing as the financial one.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, the ""fairness"" of the split doesn't matter if I can't rely on the car being clean or fueled for my morning.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, that's why we need a system that assigns responsibility clearly, rather than this vague collective.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I don't want to spend an hour a week on logs... it just feels like more work.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Minako,,We need to balance the financial reality Shion found with the emotional friction Benjamin and I noticed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Exactly. If we move to a strict recording system, we might just replace fuel arguments with ""log-book"" arguments.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"I just want to know that when it's my turn, the car is actually ready to drive.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Shion,,"The data shows the current ""informal"" way is failing everyone. We need a structured allocation.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,Maybe something where we don't have to coordinate every single time?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
